text.section:
There is hereby established the Transportation Public-Private Partnership Steering Committee (the Committee) to evaluate and review financing options for the development and/or operation of transportation facility or facilities.
			The Committee shall consist of the following members:

Two members of the Commonwealth Transportation Board;


The staff director of the House Committee on Appropriations, or his designee, and the staff director of the Senate Committee on Finance and Appropriations, or his designee;


A Deputy Secretary of Transportation who shall serve as the chairman;


The chief financial officer of either the Department of Transportation or the Department of Rail and Public Transportation, as appropriate; and


A nonagency public financial expert, as selected by the Secretary of Transportation.
